            <title>2.8.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 14:35:15 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/hoomanaskari/mac-dictate-anywhere</link>
            <sparkle:version>35</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.8.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.8.0

- Added S1-mini by Superwhisper as a private, fully local cleanup option for final English transcripts.
- Added one-click download and deletion of the pinned 462 MB model, with visible progress and integrity verification before installation.
- Added S1-mini's trained styling, structure, and email/general context controls, with Metal acceleration on Apple Silicon and CPU support on Intel Macs.
- Kept live preview transcription unchanged: S1-mini runs only after dictation finishes, and the original transcript is preserved if local cleanup cannot run.
- Reorganized Transcript Cleanup settings so the selected method's setup, availability, and privacy behavior are easier to understand.
]]></description>
